    "title": "Kingsbury Man Arrested Twice in One Day After Defying Stay-Away Order - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Renee Broussard ,\n2 days ago\nA Kingsbury man was arrested twice in a single day after deputies say he violated a stay-away order of protection shortly after his release, returning to the same residence he had allegedly caused trouble at earlier. William V. Kuster, who is from Kingsbury, now faces a mix of misdemeanor and felony charges stemming from the back-to-back incidents on Oct. 25.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
